sottero marianne In blush. I have located the dress in some salons near me. My mom wants to go to kleinfeld,  but I&#039;m worried that they hike up the prices.","Attachments":[],"Id":1884058,"PostDate":1422175824,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love the maggie sottero marianne In blush. I have located the dress in some salons near me. My mom wants to go to kleinfeld,  but I'm worried that they hike up the prices.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 13 guests + bride and groom + 2 kids = 40 room nights","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401274070,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.244.44.113","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78676,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae04d7102b6033f7890733783634df4f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I wouldn&#039;t be surprised with the TV exposure they have.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you tried doing an online search for other vendors?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884095,"PostDate":1422198252,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I wouldn't be surprised with the TV exposure they have.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you tried doing an online search for other vendors?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"kathy@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"50.143.153.161","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1390989864,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TAkathy","Id":276390,"Name":"TAkathy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78676,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa469dc3774ad26f5b82dc8bcf8dbc68","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I agree with @[member=\"TAkathy\"]. It wouldn&#039;t surprise me if the prices are a little overinflated. You could always go just for the experience, but I don&#039;t know if you want to buy your dress there! lol Do they even sell Maggie Sottero? I would think a lower priced line like that - compared to the Pninas - wouldn&#039;t be up to their standards! You never see someone on tv buy a Maggie! lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884097,"PostDate":1422199949,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I agree with @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276390\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276390-takathy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TAkathy<\/span><\/a>. It wouldn't surprise me if the prices are a little overinflated. You could always go just for the experience, but I don't know if you want to buy your dress there! lol Do they even sell Maggie Sottero? I would think a lower priced line like that - compared to the Pninas - wouldn't be up to their standards! You never see someone on tv buy a Maggie! lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283430199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1393821808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.45.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78676,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d42f3dea949088ce8dbee632d3f7c43d","RawContent":"Just do some price checks at stores and if you want to buy at Kleinfeld for whatever reason ask them to price match if their prices are not the lowest. If they do your a customer, if not you will already know where to go to buy it. It will be the same dress either way. \n\n\nAlso....hmmm idk because the biggest most sought after bridal boutique in Cincinnati, (my hometown) has the lowest prices on their bridal gowns of any shops around here. Usually they sell so many dresses that they can afford to lower the markups just enough to make you feel like your getting a deal. \n\nNever know until you try! \n\n\nAnd it&#039;s important to know also that it does NOT matter the amount of money you spend on your dress your bridal consultant should make you feel like a VIP all the way! She&#039;s going to get a commission so make sure you take your time, and get the VIP treatment you deserve!","Attachments":[],"Id":1884105,"PostDate":1422203211,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just do some price checks at stores and if you want to buy at Kleinfeld for whatever reason ask them to price match if their prices are not the lowest. If they do your a customer, if not you will already know where to go to buy it. It will be the same dress either way. <br><br>\nAlso....hmmm idk because the biggest most sought after bridal boutique in Cincinnati, (my hometown) has the lowest prices on their bridal gowns of any shops around here. Usually they sell so many dresses that they can afford to lower the markups just enough to make you feel like your getting a deal. <br>\nNever know until you try! <br><br>\nAnd it's important to know also that it does NOT matter the amount of money you spend on your dress your bridal consultant should make you feel like a VIP all the way! She's going to get a commission so make sure you take your time, and get the VIP treatment you deserve!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401107633,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.115.239.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78676,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3426e87262bdb3b615598bf73c4d5015","RawContent":"Yea, my friend got her Watters dress from kleinfeld and she said that it was the same as other stores, but her dress was $3000. They do sell maggie sottero and I saw the dress I want on their website. I saw an episode of a girl buying a maggie, but i didn&#039;t catch the price. My aunt has a friend that is a consultant at the store. I&#039;ve been to a few stores and some of the reviews are horrible and I didn&#039;t like the customer service at a few. I am selling my Maggie sottero divina because I want a different maggie. I just rather have good service if I&#039;m spending all this money on an item.","Attachments":[],"Id":1884132,"PostDate":1422219977,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yea, my friend got her Watters dress from kleinfeld and she said that it was the same as other stores, but her dress was $3000. They do sell maggie sottero and I saw the dress I want on their website. I saw an episode of a girl buying a maggie, but i didn't catch the price. My aunt has a friend that is a consultant at the store. I've been to a few stores and some of the reviews are horrible and I didn't like the customer service at a few. I am selling my Maggie sottero divina because I want a different maggie. I just rather have good service if I'm spending all this money on an item.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>So far 13 guests + bride and groom + 2 kids = 40 room nights","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401274070,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.109.193.151","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78676,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"622853d9e4b938f4fb9ba4faa62b4308","RawContent":"Hello all my dress was a maggie sottero from kleinfelds nyc !!","Attachments":[],"Id":1884218,"PostDate":1422285272,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello all my dress was a maggie sottero from kleinfelds nyc !!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dfrey607@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"100.1.103.157","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1370065927,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270172.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wedding2014","Id":270172,"Name":"Wedding2014","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78676","Title":"Does Kleinfeld Raise Prices","LastPostDate":1422285272},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
