{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6c081b1350bc24f6768507b711c93d5","RawContent":"Hey girls, I finally went in for my fitting this weekend and I have pics! It looks a little funny because it still has pins in it and only half of the bustle pinned up, but you get the idea.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/dress1-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":2030,"PostDate":1159783147,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey girls, I finally went in for my fitting this weekend and I have pics! It looks a little funny because it still has pins in it and only half of the bustle pinned up, but you get the idea.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/dress1-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janet.daly@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.33.145.106","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1138238940,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206713.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":288,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Janet","Id":206713,"Name":"Janet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3666d565d06ba84e5d17c14257d7dbfe","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;TAMMYM&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I love that dress Janet. I told you this already but I will again.. :-) I tried it on and it is very pretty and the sash really makes that dress..&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks, Tammy. I agree - I love the sash! My FI is wearing a khaki-ish colored suit, so I think they will look even better together. Here is a pic of the sash (being bustled):\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/dress6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":2036,"PostDate":1159784911,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>TAMMYM<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I love that dress Janet. I told you this already but I will again.. :-) I tried it on and it is very pretty and the sash really makes that dress..<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks, Tammy. I agree - I love the sash! My FI is wearing a khaki-ish colored suit, so I think they will look even better together. Here is a pic of the sash (being bustled):<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i67.photobucket.com\/albums\/h304\/loveisblonde2\/dress6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"janet.daly@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.33.145.106","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1138238940,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206713.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":288,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Janet","Id":206713,"Name":"Janet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c0a3ef745cdfa7287d48cd7f16c4869","RawContent":"UPDATED: This is my TTD dress\n \n Ok here&#039;s my dress....maybe. I bought this dress the week after I got engaged. One of the bridal shops in town had donated their discontinued styles to a local thrift store and one of my coworkers saw this dress and sent me in after it. It really does fit the &amp;quot;beach&amp;quot; theme well, with the blue beads on the bodice, but I just don&#039;t know if it&#039;s fancy enough for me. It was an $800 dress and I paid $99. So...tell me what you think. I&#039;m tempted to just go dress shopping and find something that I LOVE, rather than this dress that I just &amp;quot;like&amp;quot;. Of course, I think I loved this dress at first, but now that I&#039;ve looked at some others I don&#039;t like this as much (Karla, I know what you mean!) \n Sorry that the pics aren&#039;t so good. It&#039;s really hard to get this dress on by yourself because it laces up the back, and my puppy kept trying to get in the way (he&#039;s in the last picture- Loomis, the Jack Russell Terrier, 6 mo old).\n Here is the dress:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/dress002.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n This is the bodice with beading detail:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/dress003.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n This pic shows the slit down the side. There is beading on the fabric inside the slit, kinda hard to see in the photo:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/dress005.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":2074,"PostDate":1159803300,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                UPDATED: This is my TTD dress<br \/> <br \/> Ok here's my dress....maybe. I bought this dress the week after I got engaged. One of the bridal shops in town had donated their discontinued styles to a local thrift store and one of my coworkers saw this dress and sent me in after it. It really does fit the \"beach\" theme well, with the blue beads on the bodice, but I just don't know if it's fancy enough for me. It was an $800 dress and I paid $99. So...tell me what you think. I'm tempted to just go dress shopping and find something that I LOVE, rather than this dress that I just \"like\". Of course, I think I loved this dress at first, but now that I've looked at some others I don't like this as much (Karla, I know what you mean!) <br \/> Sorry that the pics aren't so good. It's really hard to get this dress on by yourself because it laces up the back, and my puppy kept trying to get in the way (he's in the last picture- Loomis, the Jack Russell Terrier, 6 mo old).<br \/> Here is the dress:<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/dress002.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> This is the bodice with beading detail:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/dress003.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> This pic shows the slit down the side. There is beading on the fabric inside the slit, kinda hard to see in the photo:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/dress005.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aqharider@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"76.20.179.61","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1154359380,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/9\/9f\/9fd8e240_user-274-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sarah","Id":206770,"Name":"Sarah","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a2a45ba88066578ec226a47c5f1dbb0","RawContent":"I don&#039;t have a picture of me in my dress, but heres a pic of it:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img57.imageshack.us\/img57\/6118\/mydresswm2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":2099,"PostDate":1159807102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I don't have a picture of me in my dress, but heres a pic of it:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img57.imageshack.us\/img57\/6118\/mydresswm2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Karla&Ronnie<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.juancarlostapia.com\/Karla&Ronnie2\/karla.html\">Wedding Slideshow<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.juancarlostapia.com\/Karla&Ronnie\/index.html\">Engagement Slideshow<\/a><br><span>May 5, 2007Westin Resort and Spa Los Cabos<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.karlazepeda.com\">Custom Stationery and Wedding Invitations<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rzspike@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1158591720,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206811.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":50,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KarlaV","Id":206811,"Name":"KarlaV","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0dc27eb8ba79a7e095480f397df6c635","RawContent":"I find it too hard to make the pics small enough to upload and i am technologically challenged with the other method so here is a link to see my dress :)\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jengonda9.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n it is all ivory silk chiffon with silver art deco style beading. it goes with the vintage art deco ring my honey bought for me :)\n \n AND I am for sure going to slather myself in baby oil just like the model!!!\n \n my ladies are wearing a black chiffon dress found here:\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.jasminebridal.com\/html\/web1\/b2_3_photo1.asp?id=144\"&gt;http:\/\/www.jasminebridal.com\/html\/we...to1.asp?id=144&lt;\/a&gt;\n &lt;strong&gt;12\/18\/08 - LINK NO LONGER VALID&lt;\/strong&gt;\n \n And by the way AKH - I tried that dress on and it is beautiful! not at all too much for the beach! i bought my dress in june and am STILL obsessed with bridal fashion","Attachments":[],"Id":4917,"PostDate":1162174847,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I find it too hard to make the pics small enough to upload and i am technologically challenged with the other method so here is a link to see my dress <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jengonda9.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> it is all ivory silk chiffon with silver art deco style beading. it goes with the vintage art deco ring my honey bought for me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> AND I am for sure going to slather myself in baby oil just like the model!!!<br \/> <br \/> my ladies are wearing a black chiffon dress found here:<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.jasminebridal.com\/html\/web1\/b2_3_photo1.asp?id=144' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.jasminebr....to1.asp?id=144<\/a><br \/> <strong>12\/18\/08 - LINK NO LONGER VALID<\/strong><br \/> <br \/> And by the way AKH - I tried that dress on and it is beautiful! not at all too much for the beach! i bought my dress in june and am STILL obsessed with bridal fashion\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong><i>Jen & Aaron<br>January 13, 2007<\/i><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jengonda@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1147886400,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206735.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":93,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JENGONDA9","Id":206735,"Name":"JENGONDA9","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f2cdf982fe828d9c00294e0e47aa313","RawContent":"So this week I went to my hometown to visit my parents, and my MOH who was visiting her parents. We went dress shopping on Tuesday and I totally didn&#039;t think I would find anything. I have been in every store in Lansing and couldn&#039;t find anything that really jumped out at me as &amp;quot;the one&amp;quot;. Well, I found it! It was the second dress I tried on. I knew as soon as I put it on that my search was finally over. It is totally different than anything I would have ever pictured myself wearing, it is so simple, but yet screams WOW when I have it on. I&#039;ve never had a dress do that before. \n I was really sad because I love the side gather style and the pick ups, but because I&#039;m so short those dresses just don&#039;t look quite right on me. This dress it exactly what Jeff has described too, so I know 200% for sure that he will love it.\n Sorry about the pics, it&#039;s so hard to get a good dress picture!\n \n Close up of bodice detail. This is the only detail on the dress. Notice the top is champagne colored and the bottom is white.\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/NewDress1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/NewDress2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I love my veil. It is as long as my dress and has scalloped beaded edging with a waist length blusher.\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/NewDress4.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The back just has buttons all the way down and there is the same detailing as the front. \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/NewDress5.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":5684,"PostDate":1162572396,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So this week I went to my hometown to visit my parents, and my MOH who was visiting her parents. We went dress shopping on Tuesday and I totally didn't think I would find anything. I have been in every store in Lansing and couldn't find anything that really jumped out at me as \"the one\". Well, I found it! It was the second dress I tried on. I knew as soon as I put it on that my search was finally over. It is totally different than anything I would have ever pictured myself wearing, it is so simple, but yet screams WOW when I have it on. I've never had a dress do that before. <br \/> I was really sad because I love the side gather style and the pick ups, but because I'm so short those dresses just don't look quite right on me. This dress it exactly what Jeff has described too, so I know 200% for sure that he will love it.<br \/> Sorry about the pics, it's so hard to get a good dress picture!<br \/> <br \/> Close up of bodice detail. This is the only detail on the dress. Notice the top is champagne colored and the bottom is white.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/NewDress1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/NewDress2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I love my veil. It is as long as my dress and has scalloped beaded edging with a waist length blusher.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/NewDress4.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The back just has buttons all the way down and there is the same detailing as the front. <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/NewDress5.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aqharider@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"76.20.179.61","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1154359380,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/9\/9f\/9fd8e240_user-274-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sarah","Id":206770,"Name":"Sarah","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f95ce82ddbaf6fef3ea1253e16d2beeb","RawContent":"Oh, and thanks for letting me know the designer, also. I went to the Venus webpage and I found this:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i7.tinypic.com\/2j2xjwm.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I like the dress is kinda cool, but mostly what caught my attention is what she has on her head. I thought it was a fruit basket at first glance! LOL!","Attachments":[],"Id":7932,"PostDate":1163793141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh, and thanks for letting me know the designer, also. I went to the Venus webpage and I found this:<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i7.tinypic.com\/2j2xjwm.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I like the dress is kinda cool, but mostly what caught my attention is what she has on her head. I thought it was a fruit basket at first glance! LOL!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caroljohnston_2000@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1161800971,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206870.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"carolj","Id":206870,"Name":"carolj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e67519bf9065fb00325787e8f6d212a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;HBBRIDE&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Kashmira,\n \n I clicked on the link but was unsuccessful. I would like to see the dress....\n \n My dress was way more than I ever thougt I would pay. It is actually being made to fit me and it hasn&#039;t been started yet. I was waiting until after the holidays...hoping to loose a few pounds...yeah right!!! It is hard when you fall in love with a dress becasue you will compare it to every other dress you try on!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Kristi - Try this link:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-kash.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n For some reason none of the websites are allowing me to save the picture to my desktop...","Attachments":[],"Id":8910,"PostDate":1164496411,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>HBBRIDE<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Kashmira,<br \/> <br \/> I clicked on the link but was unsuccessful. I would like to see the dress....<br \/> <br \/> My dress was way more than I ever thougt I would pay. It is actually being made to fit me and it hasn't been started yet. I was waiting until after the holidays...hoping to loose a few pounds...yeah right!!! It is hard when you fall in love with a dress becasue you will compare it to every other dress you try on!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Kristi - Try this link:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-kash.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> For some reason none of the websites are allowing me to save the picture to my desktop...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kashmira & Dan<\/span><br><span>Happily married since June 16, 2007<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/IMG_0769.jpg\">http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l1...a\/IMG_0769.jpg<\/a><br><span>Our mini-video: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html\">http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html<\/a><br><span>Photo slideshow: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php\">http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"gkashmira@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1156778760,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206698.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gkashmira","Id":206698,"Name":"gkashmira","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9fc78db3c29b7b614231a1fdae15e240","RawContent":"Finally found my dress!\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-genesis.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":9432,"PostDate":1164815795,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Finally found my dress!<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-genesis.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenesis@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1154941980,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206775.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JENESIS","Id":206775,"Name":"JENESIS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ce724d988fb7136a1060398de6b46a8","RawContent":"Here&#039;s mine!\n Trying it on....yeah clips would have helped you dingbat saleslady, oh well guess I&#039;ll have to order it online for 1\/4 the price!!!! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile105.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile105\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/procserv\/47b6d907b3127cce8b00122a6fe800000015108AYtHLJy1Ztu\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n \n After jumping out of the shower and tackling the UPS man, I immediately put on my dress. That&#039;s normal, right? &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bride.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bride\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/procserv\/47b6d732b3127cce8c8b9d35974100000015108AYtHLJy1Ztu\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":9610,"PostDate":1164891762,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here's mine!<br \/> Trying it on....yeah clips would have helped you dingbat saleslady, oh well guess I'll have to order it online for 1\/4 the price!!!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile105.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile105\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/procserv\/47b6d907b3127cce8b00122a6fe800000015108AYtHLJy1Ztu\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> After jumping out of the shower and tackling the UPS man, I immediately put on my dress. That's normal, right? <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bride.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bride\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/im1.shutterfly.com\/procserv\/47b6d732b3127cce8c8b9d35974100000015108AYtHLJy1Ztu\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mary & Corey March 23, 2007 Puerto Vallarta <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.coreyandmary.com\">www.coreyandmary.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20070323\/e\/we+get+hitched+in+Mexico\/dt\/-1\/k\/f11e\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f11e\/event.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/co_profileview.htm?profilename=kookaloons\">Knot Bio<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kookaloons@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1164838320,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206938.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kookaloons","Id":206938,"Name":"kookaloons","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8219,"TotalPages":822,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":8210},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
